  "product": {
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Looking for a fun and stylish way to show your family's style? Look no further than this matching dress and t-shirt set! This set includes a long, flowy dress for mom, a short, flowy dress for daughter, a relaxed-fit Hawaiian shirt for dad, and a matching t-shirt for son. All of the pieces in this set are made of a lightweight, breathable fabric that is perfect for summer.</p>\n<p>The dresses feature a floral print in shades of blue, green, and pink, while the shirts feature a red and white Hawaiian print. The dresses are both approximately 50 inches long, while the shirts are both approximately 21 inches long. The dresses have a v-neckline and capped sleeves, while the shirts have a button-down front and short sleeves.</p>\n<p>This matching set is perfect for a casual day out or a special occasion. It's also a great way to show your family's bond and style. Order your set today!</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Matching dress and t-shirt set for mom, dad, and kids</li>\n<li>Lightweight, breathable fabric</li>\n<li>Floral print dresses and Hawaiian print shirts</li>\n<li>V-neckline and capped sleeves on dresses, button-down front and short sleeves on shirts</li>\n<li>Perfect for a casual day out or a special occasion</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>\nSIZE CHART (HTML)\n<table id=\"size-chart\"> <tr> <th>Size</th> <th>Height (cm/in)</th> <th>Son Shirt Bust (cm/in)</th> <th>Son Shirt Shoulder (cm/in)</th> <th>Son Shirt Length (cm/in)</th> <th>Daughter Dress Bust (cm/in)</th> <th>Daughter Dress Length (cm/in)</th> <th>Dad Shirt Bust (cm/in)</th> <th>Dad Shirt Shoulder (cm/in)</th> <th>Dad Shirt Length (cm/in)</th> <th>Mom Dress Bust (cm/in)</th> <th>Mom Dress Length (cm/in)</th> </tr> <tr>\n<td>24M/90</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>57</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>58</td>\n<td>58</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr> <tr>\n<td